  <name>SendyFlow</name>
  <summary>Modern API Testing &amp; Development Platform</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      SendyFlow is a high-performance desktop API development and testing platform designed for developers and engineering teams.
    </p>
    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Support for REST, GraphQL, and real-time WebSocket requests.</li>
      <li>Instant team collaboration with real-time collection and environment sync.</li>
      <li>Local loopback authentication and seamless deep-link integrations.</li>
      <li>Native desktop performance with a modern, distraction-free interface.</li>
      <li>Pre-request and post-request test scripting.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
